      "content": "but that's the thing, they wouldn't be \"saved\" by me living. they'd just be stuck watching me fail and break everything over and over again. isn't it more compassionate to just let it end with me instead of forcing them to watch the cycle repeat? it feels like the most selfless thing i could actually do is break the chain permanently so no one else has to carry it.",
